  <h1>Knowledge vault and personal plugin</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Plain markdown, Claude Code plugin, no embeddings, no MCP, no daemon.
  </p>

  <figure>
    <img
      src="/diagrams/vault-architecture.svg"
      alt="Vault architecture: inbox/ raw notes are promoted via the distil-vault skill into curated knowledge-vault/ folders (strategy, patterns, playbooks, decisions, projects), with the personal plugin shipping skills that read directly via Read, Grep, and Glob."
    />
    <figcaption class="muted">
